# MINT License Suite

This repository is the authoritative source for the MINT License Suite. It is not a work licensed under the MINT License; it is the license text repository itself.

## Contents

The license texts are located in:

- `en-US/` — English (authoritative language version)
- `zh-CN/` — Simplified Chinese

Additional languages are added as they become available.

## The Suite

| License | File |
|---|---|
| MINT (base) | `LICENSE-MINT` |
| MINT CODE module | `LICENSE-MINT-CODE` |
| MINT SOFTWARE module | `LICENSE-MINT-SOFTWARE` |
| MINT PUBLIC module | `LICENSE-MINT-PUBLIC` |
| MINT DESIGN module | `LICENSE-MINT-DESIGN` |
| MINT DATA module | `LICENSE-MINT-DATA` |

The base license and the modules are designed to be combined. See the repository `README.md` for the combination rules.

## This Repository's Own License

The license texts in this repository are released under CC0 1.0. See `README.md` for details.

## GitHub Detection

GitHub's license detector does not recognize the MINT License Suite. The repository may be labeled "Other". This is expected. The authoritative license texts are the files listed above.

## Contact

See the repository `README.md` for contribution and contact information.